## 2. Technical Architecture: The Logic

InsightStream uses a **Sequential Workflow via LangGraph** to maintain absolute control over the extraction and verification stages.

### 2.1 The Pipeline

| Stage | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Cleaning Node** | Deterministic | Standardizes text and redacts PII. Ensures the model sees high-signal input only. |
| **Diarized Filtering** | Deterministic | Isolates "Participant" turns. Cuts interviewer fluff to focus exclusively on the user's voice. |
| **Map-Reduce Extraction** | Probabilistic | Parallel chunking for $O(1)$ latency. Uses a **Global Context Injector** (recursive summary) to prevent "Loss of Narrative" when a *Why* is separated from its *What* by 40 minutes of audio. |
| **Semantic De-duplication** | Probabilistic | **Critical Cost Guardrail.** Checks if `"Login is slow"` and `"Auth takes too long"` are the same point before auditing — minimizing redundant token spend. |
| **The Auditor** | Trust Anchor | Zero-trust layer using **Semantic Entailment**. Every claim is verified against source text; unproven claims are suppressed or flagged. |
| **Weighted Synthesizer** | Probabilistic | Clusters insights into themes. Insights are weighted by **Participant Count**, not Token Frequency, to prevent "Loud User" bias. Includes a **Novelty Filter** to prioritize weird contradictions over obvious consensus. |

