## 3. Requirements: Deterministic vs. Probabilistic

| Requirement | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| PII Redaction | **Deterministic** | Rule-based, auditable |
| Speaker Diarization Filtering | **Deterministic** | Logic-driven speaker isolation |
| Insight Extraction | **Probabilistic** | LLM-driven, context-injected |
| Semantic De-duplication | **Probabilistic** | Embedding-based similarity |
| Auditor Verification | **Trust Anchor** | Semantic entailment check |
| Theme Synthesis | **Probabilistic** | Cluster-based, participant-weighted |

