## 5. Evaluation Metrics *(Technical)*

| Metric | Target | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Grounding Attribution Rate** | `100%` | Every insight must link to a transcript timestamp or it is suppressed |
| **Synthesis Coverage** | `>90%` | % of validated atomic insights represented in final themes. Dropped insights are logged and retrievable from the "Unverified" bucket |
| **Auditor Passing Rate** | *Monitoring* | Ensures the semantic entailment check isn't so strict it creates a "rejection loop" for valid but paraphrased data |
| **Manual Override Rate** | `<15%` | High rates signal systemic model failure in the Auditor or Diarization nodes |
| **Latency** | `<45s` | For 60-minute transcripts via parallelization |

> 📊 **Manual Override Rate Interpretation:** A high rate identifies exactly where the agentic logic is becoming a productivity bottleneck.

