## 7. Non-Functional Requirements

| Requirement | Specification |
|---|---|
| **Data Privacy** | Stateless processing; BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) policy |
| **Correction Log Storage** | Local encrypted cache; exportable as `Ground Truth JSON/CSV` |
| **Telemetry (Opt-in)** | Anonymized correction pairs transmitted for fine-tuning via Secure Telemetry stream |
| **Latency** | `<45s` for 60-min transcripts |
| **Fallback** | Text-only mode if media dependencies are unavailable |

